== diagnostics ==
E0101 [Error] 1566..1568 there is no `\q` escape in wolf
    note the escapes wolf understands are `\n`, `\t`, `\r`, `\0`, `\\`, `\"`, `\xNN`, and `\u{…}`. For a literal backslash, write `\\`; for text with no escapes at all, use a raw string `r"…"`.
